==> T2 tools/call getEmployee 12345 (path: Gateway -> hub door -> TGW -> firewall -> VPCE -> private API)
{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": 2,
    "result": {
        "isError": false,
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "{\"employeeId\":\"12345\",\"name\":\"Demo Employee\",\"plan\":\"Gold PPO\",\"status\":\"ACTIVE\",\"servedBy\":\"lab-employee-api in account <TOOL_ACCOUNT_ID>\",\"sourceIp\":\"10.0.2.176\",\"vpce\":\"vpce-047187bbfc02e7093\",\"tokenClientId\":\"2o6rs1n0398fh2nvaobhqlfpbu\"}"
            }
        ]
    }
}
  -> 'sourceIp' in the body should be a 10.0.x.x DOOR address (hub), proving the API sees the door IP.

